.TH "Brushtopbm User Manual" 0 "27 June 2026" "netpbm documentation"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
brushtopbm \- convert a doodle brush file into a PBM image

.UN synopsis
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBbrushtopbm\fP
[\fIbrushfile\fP]

.UN description
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This program is part of
.BR "Netpbm" (1)\c
\&.
.PP
\fBbrushtopbm\fP reads a Xerox doodle brush file as input.  and
produces a PBM image as output.


.UN options
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
There are no command line options defined specifically
for \fBbrushtopbm\fP, but it recognizes the options common to all
programs based on libnetpbm (See 
.UR index.html#commonoptions
 Common Options
.UE
\&.)

